<title>USA: Digital Systems, Viewstar to merge.</title>
<headline>Digital Systems, Viewstar to merge.</headline>
<dateline>REDMOND, Wash 1996-10-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Digital Systems International Inc and ViewStar Corp said on Monday they signed a definitive agreement to merge in a tax-free stock transaction valued at about $80 million.</p>
<p>Under terms of the agreement, approved by the boards of both companies, ViewStar shareholders would receive about 3.9 million shares of Digital Systems stock in exchange for all outstanding ViewStar shares and vested options.</p>
<p>The merger, expected to close before the end of the year, is subject to certain conditions, including the approval of the shareholders of both DSI and ViewStar.</p>
</text>
